\f1 \cf5 \cb11 \strokec5 Trong S3: Khi upload object, Amazon S3 s\uc0\u7869  s\u7917  d\u7909 ng kh\'f3a m\'e3 h\'f3a m\'e0 b\u7841 n cung c\u7845 p \u273 \u7875  \'e1p d\u7909 ng m\'e3 h\'f3a AES-256 cho d\u7919  li\u7879 u c\u7911 a b\u7841 n v\'e0 x\'f3a kh\'f3a m\'e3 h\'f3a kh\u7887 i b\u7897  nh\u7899 . \u272 i\u7873 u quan tr\u7885 ng c\u7847 n l\u432 u \'fd l\'e0 Amazon S3 kh\'f4ng l\u432 u tr\u7919  kh\'f3a m\'e3 h\'f3a m\'e0 b\u7841 n cung c\u7845 p. Thay v\'e0o \u273 \'f3, n\'f3 \u273 \u432 \u7907 c l\u432 u tr\u7919  trong gi\'e1 tr\u7883  HMAC \u273 \u432 \u7907 c \u273 \'e1nh d\u7845 u ng\u7851 u nhi\'ean c\u7911 a kh\'f3a m\'e3 h\'f3a \u273 \u7875  x\'e1c th\u7921 c c\'e1c y\'eau c\u7847 u trong t\u432 \u417 ng lai.\
 -> The salted HMAC value cannot be used to derive the value of the encryption key or to decrypt the contents of the encrypted object. That means, if you lose the encryption key, you lose the object.\
